#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.rst:2
msgid "BaseUI"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI:1
msgid "Classe de base représentant une vue Qt associée à un paramètre."
msgstr "Base class representing a Qt view associated with a setting."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI:3
msgid "Cette classe encapsule tous les objets Qt nécessaires à l'affichage d'un paramètre dans une interface utilisateur."
msgstr "This class encapsulates all the Qt objects needed to display a setting in a user interface."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI:5
msgid "Elle est conçue pour être instanciée plusieurs fois pour un même paramètre, afin de permettre la duplication d'interface (multi-fenêtres, preview, etc.)."
msgstr "It is designed to be instantiated multiple times for a single setting, to allow for interface duplication (multi-window, preview, etc.)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI:7
msgid "Chaque instance est indépendante en termes de widgets Qt, mais synchronisée avec le modèle de données auquel elle est associée."
msgstr "Each instance is independent in terms of Qt widgets, but synchronized with the data model to which it is associated."

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.rst of
#: palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI
msgid "Paramètres"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.rst:9
msgid "Attributs"
msgstr "Attributes"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI.layout:1
msgid "Calque principal (:class:`QVBoxLayout` dans la plupart des cas, :class:`QHBoxLayout` pour des cas particuliers)."
msgstr "Main layout (:class:`QVBoxLayout` in most cases, :class:`QHBoxLayout` for special cases)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI.boxes:1
msgid "Objets QT permettant de manipuler le paramètre (:class:`QCheckBox`, :class:`QSpinBox`, :class:`QComboBox`...)."
msgstr "Qt objects used to manipulate the setting (:class:`QCheckBox`, :class:`QSpinBox`, :class:`QComboBox`...)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI.label:1
msgid ":class:`QLabel` contenant le nom du paramètre."
msgstr ":class:`QLabel` containing the setting name."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI.form:1
msgid "Formulaire parent dans lequel est le paramètre (utile lors d'un Hide & Seek)."
msgstr "Parent form in which the setting is located (useful during a Hide & Seek)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI.row:1
msgid "Position dans le formulaire parent (utile lors d'un Hide & Seek)."
msgstr "Position within the parent form (useful during Hide & Seek)."

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.rst:18
msgid "Méthodes"
msgstr "Methods"

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.rst:21
msgid "Layout management"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI.attach_to_form:1
msgid "Enregistre le :class:`QFormLayout` et la position dans le formulaire pour permettre un show/hide propre."
msgstr "Registers the :class:`QFormLayout` and the position within the form to enable clean show/hide operations."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI.attach_to_form:3
msgid ":class:`QFormLayout` dans lequel va être inséré le paramètre."
msgstr ":class:`QFormLayout` into which the setting will be inserted."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI.hide:1
msgid "Cache le paramètre."
msgstr "Hides the setting."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI.show:1
msgid "Affiche le paramètre."
msgstr "Shows the setting."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI.set_tooltip:1
msgid "Ajoute un tooltip au Label."
msgstr "Adds a tooltip to the Label."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Types.BaseUI.BaseUI.set_tooltip:3
msgid "Tooltip à ajouter."
msgstr "Tooltip to be added."
